  "appeal_start_date": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of its excessive height, bulk and massing, particularly on the southern elevation where there is no setback together with the utilitarian appearance of the lift extension, would appear visually intrusive, overly dominant, stark and would detract from the architectural coherence of the existing building, introducing an overbearing form that would appear harsh and unrelieved when viewed from adjacent properties and public viewpoints. The proposal would therefore result in an unsympathetic form of development contrary to policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan 2021 and policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018."
  ],
